 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0031/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0031</a>|2026/07/08 13:48| 01 | 294| 038| 0245| 0106| 0137| 0487|    \n  <a href=\"CME0030/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0030</a>|2026/07/08 11:36| 01 | 275| 008| 0449| 0161| 0384| 0761|    \n  <a href=\"CME0029/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0029</a>|2026/07/08 06:24| 02 | 271| 080| 0694| 0148| 0332| 1007|    \n  <a href=\"CME0028/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0028</a>|2026/07/08 06:24| 02 | 197| 028| 0343| 0014| 0308| 0351|    \n  <a href=\"CME0027/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0027</a>|2026/07/08 05:36| 02 | 333| 016| 0367| 0138| 0297| 0625|    \n  <a href=\"CME0026/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0026</a>|2026/07/07 23:24| 02 | 285| 056| 041"
